| Full screen-reader support | Real accessibility work takes longer than a hackathon allows to do properly; doing it badly is worse than stating it's next |
| Prescription scanning / auto-registration | OCR-from-prescription accuracy risk is a real product problem, not a hackathon one |
| Offline mode | Adds infrastructure complexity with zero demo value |

